<title>UK: GOLF-NORMAN TO PLAY IN LANCOME TROPHY.</title>
<headline>GOLF-NORMAN TO PLAY IN LANCOME TROPHY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>World number one Greg Norman will rejoin the European Tour for the Lancome Trophy at Saint-Nom-la-Breteche Golf Club near Paris in September, his spokesman said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Norman has played in two Tour events this year, finishing second in both the Desert Classic in Dubai and the Spanish Open.</p>
<p>It will be his fourth appearance in the Lancome Trophy. He finished in a tie for third place in both 1983 and 1988.</p>
</text>
